{"title":"2005 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, the notation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d4321dbea9f298dfe9c114d4c440694632bed8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\diamond b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c30d05e56161d6ef29d2514560e67f60d593dac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a7301c9a7acd5239967ae52397b000ddc70c1760.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\diamond 3 = 5^{2} - 4(3) = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"175\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/1/a91ce04f2715f734abb7f556100f26f284d91b07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/5/6f52dc89591f005f9be65b13c0463c19a1f3fa96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\diamond b = a^{2} - 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a2481c8d89c44df0281ec434cd45ed05ffe70ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond 3 = 2^{2} - 4(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca67980c7d6b96893ace026b04425e9ae94c301c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4 - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb7c0a41387f24b475bf3af0e79aa19904b08902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{-8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"56\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205447\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 300/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1841/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.092      1 2005_CEMC_Hy